exit 0
--- stdout
deedglass · the execution and accountability layer for AI agents

Usage  deedglass <command> [flags]

Setup
  init                Set up Deedglass in this directory
  doctor              Check config, database and keys
  connect             Put your own Postgres behind Deedglass
  scan                Show what your agent setup can change
  play                Watch the 301 scene offline, no Docker
  serve               Run the API, the rules and the Console
  migrate             Apply or check database migrations
                      up · status · verify
  config print        Show the effective config, secrets hidden
  lockdown            Turn on the strictest setup, or check it
                      status · on · off · ack
  version             Show the client and server versions
  keys                Manage seal keys
                      gen · rotate · list
  licence             Check this machine's licence (none needed)
                      activate · show · refresh · deactivate
  vault               Check or rotate the credential vault
                      status · rotate
  completion          Print shell completion
                      zsh · bash · fish
Agents
  agent               Register and control agents
                      create · list · show · suspend · resume · stop · start
  agent keys          Manage an agent's API keys
                      create · list · roll · revoke
  agent intent        Manage an agent's signed-intent keys
                      keygen · add · list · remove · mode
  org                 Create orgs and keys; stop or start all
                      create · login-link · keys · stop-all · start-all
Policies
  policy              Write, test and activate policies
                      lint · fmt · test · push · activate · evaluate · replay ·
                      diff · install
  policy packs        List or check the policy packs
                      list · verify
  guard shell         Check a shell command before an agent runs it
Actions
  act                 Send a test action through Deedglass
  actions             Inspect actions
                      list · show · cancel
  approve · deny      Decide a pending approval
  approvals           List pending approvals
                      list · show · open
  undo                Preview or run an undo
                      preview · run
  observe             Watch what changed while an agent ran
                      run · start · stop · list · show · undo · exclude
  webhooks            Send events to your endpoints
                      create · list · test · delete
Records
  verify              Check records offline
  export              Write records as OTel, OCSF, PROV or FHIR
  security-pack       Answer a security review from your records
                      readiness · build · verify
  report              Report what your agents did in a week or month
  clients             List every org you look after
  deeds               Browse and export records
                      list · show · share · export · timestamp · seal-file
  ledger              Check or prune the Ledger
                      check · prune
Connectors
  connector           Connect tools
                      create · list · show · test · types · credentials
  connector postgres  Prepare a Postgres database
                      init · check
  connector gmail     Authorize the Gmail connector
                      authorize
  decoder             Inspect Postgres change readers
                      status · drop
  witness             Compare actions with other change feeds
                      debezium
  slack manifest      Print the Slack app manifest
MCP and A2A
  mcp                 Put Deedglass in front of MCP servers
                      wrap · serve · snippet · install-links
  a2a                 Put Deedglass in front of a remote A2A agent
                      proxy
Insights
  insights            Suggestions, shadow results and anomalies
                      stats · shadow · anomalies · detect · settings ·
                      suggestions · digest
Dev
  dev                 Local helpers
                      seed · fake-action · simulate · agent-script ·
                      mail-preview · sign-intent · stripe-fixtures

Global flags  --json · --server <url> · --api-key <key> · --org <id> ·
              --no-color · -v
Run deedglass help <command> for details · https://docs.deedglass.com
